{"id": "De15bfEPMcP", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"GOOGLE\" to get Google Artemis and let your Claude Code automate your phone.\n\nGoogle just open sourced a free AI tool that lets your Claude Code use a real phone, just like a human.\n\nIt can open apps, tap through screens, create accounts, and change settings.\n\nEverything you'd normally do with your thumbs.\n\nYour agent just does it for you.\n\nAnd then it sends you back the results.\n\nIt even has a 99% success rate on a major benchmark.\n\nThat's a pretty high bar for a free tool.\n\nThe tool is called Artemis.\n\nAnd it's already crossed 13,000 stars on Google's GitHub.\n\nThink of it like handing your phone to a very patient assistant.\n\nWith it, you can run full end to end automations.\n\nYou can test your own apps on a real device.\n\nOr hand off the boring stuff you do on your phone every day.\n\nPlus it comes with its own MCP server.\n\nSo it plugs straight into Claude Code, Codex, and other coding agents.\n\nAnd it's completely free and open source.\n\n#googleai #googleartemis #claudecode #aiagent #phoenautomation", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792769943, "like_count": 2613, "comment_count": 2417, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-28405361855800925a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.506, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN8MELirSsxF_EiF4iNxdfvHUfRvnCODWt-tYuXiUN_KvdoA7z6k5kbyrf_2cjhxvpjzP3iyY2NoNEBpRyX0yZ1nvNLkcfWk1cJxbk.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Adq-CvFedFwC5jdpCUyGz7afv1cVp6ZnkndsfUcrjezgMV2f2feQlvMXVyeKW2T-Gdw&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=64JiBYdp6HYQ7kNvwEkpFy2&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=i9QQ7VjC9ss06oq2Gij6TQ&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRTBshgGREz1nACMjDsdhb2